{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07309","headline":"自鄱阳还道中寄褚徵君 · 刘长卿","name":"自鄱阳还道中寄褚徵君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南风日夜起，万里孤帆漾。\n元气连洞庭，夕阳落波上。\n故人烟水隔，复此遥相望。\n江信久寂寥，楚云独惆怅。\n爱君清川口，弄月时櫂唱。\n白首无子孙，一生自疎旷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}